# Local operator secrets - never commit.
# backfill-requests.py reads FORM_BRIDGE_SECRET.txt from this folder, so the
# form-bridge credential sits inside the working tree by design. The CSV export
# patterns above already cover the submission files; this covers the secret.
FORM_BRIDGE_SECRET.txt
*.secret
.env.local
